                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为确保团学联日常工作的顺利开展，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9月26日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，我校在养新书藏二号报告厅举行了第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">次学生代表大会暨第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">届团学联主席团选举大会。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在大会正式开始前，校团委对候选人进行审核，并最终确定了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位正式候选人参加大会竞选。近两百名高一、高二各班的学生代表及第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">届团学联主要学生干部共同参与本次大会。第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">届团学联副主席、学生团委副书记</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">李乔</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">任大会主席。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在庄严的国歌声中，大会正式开始。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">纪委</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">书记、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副校长杨佩琼</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师为大会致辞，指出团学联是学校教育的重要力量</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">强调了新一届团学联工作的重点，并对团学干部提出了希望与要求。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第一项议程：审议第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">届团学联工作报告</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">届团学联主席</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱浩川</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作了题为《笃行不怠续凯歌 行稳致远开新篇》的主席团工作报告，从“薪火不息承历史，承前启后迎未来”“存古开新寻进步，永葆赤心求发展”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“求真笃行踏实地，知行合一沐清风”三</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">个方面呈现了团学联过去一学年的工作亮点，并提出了对新一届团学联的期待。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第二项议程：审议202</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学年学生社团工作报告</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">社团联合会主席</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">鲁予同</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作了题为《展学生风采 谱社团新章》的学生社团工作报告，分别从学术科技类社团、文艺拓展类社团、公益服务类社团入手，展现了过去一学年学生社团的风采与成就。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第三项议程：表决第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">届团学联主席团选举办法（草案）</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第四项议程：表决大会主席团名单（草案）</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第五项议程：表决总监票人、总计票人名单（草案）</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第六项议程：选举第二十</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">届团学联主席团</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位候选人根据会前的抽签顺序，就各自的基本情况、对工作岗位的认知以及当选后的工作设想依次发表演说，让学生代表对他们有了更深的了解。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞选秉持公平、公正、公开的原则，学生代表一人一票，庄严行使自己民主选举的权利。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在全体代表的监督下，最终的选举结果产生。新一届主席团成员为</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">楼芷欣、屠健修、李卓远、俞晨旭、李子聪</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。相信新一届主席团能够不负众望，开创一中团学联新的未来，助力一中学子成长。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901448532.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901448532.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901450220.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901450220.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901228741.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901228741.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901220204.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901220204.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901266954.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901266954.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901276007.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901276007.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901300678.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901300678.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901331002.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901331002.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901369403.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901369403.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901402700.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901402700.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901436377.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901436377.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070901435165.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070901435165.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span>
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900417620.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900417620.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900400629.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900400629.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900228521.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900228521.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900269578.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900269578.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900306935.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900306935.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900345937.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900345937.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900348800.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900348800.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410070900381568.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202410070900381568.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
